<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo">
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it attributes a declaration (linguistic object) about a constraint to the agent responsible for it. The original property has domain prov:Entity and range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range crm:E39_Actor (also prov:Agent).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS attribuisce una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) relativa a una costrizione all'agente che ne è responsabile. La proprietà originale ha come domain prov:Entity e come range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range crm:E39_Actor (anche prov:Agent).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was attributed to</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è stato attribuito a</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
